'''''In the Dangerous Muddy Swamp''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[In the Sweltering Morning Sun]].

==Steps==
# Report the good news of your victory to Natasha
# Go to the Great Mine and comfort the Underworlders
# Bring the good news to Gertie at the Goethe Grand Hotel
# Go to Rivet Town and find the members of the Moles
# Find Julian and talk to him
# Find the Moles who are hiding
# Return to Natasha
# Go to the Robot Settlement and inform Clara and Svarog
# Follow Perkins the Robot
# Inform Clara and Svarog

