----
:'''Antonia:''' ...Here, take it. I'm afraid we're short on goods and materials right now.
:'''Humble Vagrant:''' Oh, well we actually have enough for the moment. You hang onto it...
:'''March 7th:''' Hey! Are you guys causing trouble again?
:'''Antonia:''' It's you! Oh, no, no, you misunderstand...
:'''Antonia:''' There was a huge quake at the mine just now &mdash; part of it collapsed. If the vagrants here hadn't stopped to help, I doubt we'd have gotten everyone out in one piece.
:'''Antonia:''' I was just discussing how to repay them. It's a shame the mining team is hard up right now.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Wanna hear something really great?
::'''Antonia:''' Oh? To do with us? I'm listening...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I've got you covered.
::'''March 7th:''' Uh... can't we get Bronya to cover the bill?
::'''March 7th:''' Ugh, can we focus? (Trailblazer), tell them the good news already!
:{{Black Screen|Telling the mining team and the vagrants about the victory...}}
:'''Antonia:''' You mean to say that... we're about to be reunited with the Overworld?
:'''Humble Vagrant:''' Are you serious!? This has... gotta be a dream. Good things... don't happen to us!
:'''March 7th:''' Today they do! And you're not dreaming. If you don't believe us, pinch yourself!
:'''Antonia:''' If things go back to the way they were 10 years ago... then the mining team can finally escape this poverty...
:'''Antonia:''' ...and you won't have to rely on the charity of others. We'll finally be living with the dignity we deserve.
:'''Humble Vagrant:''' I... *sniff* *sob*
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Come on. Wipe your tears.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let it out!
:'''Antonia:''' Thank you, outsiders, from the bottom of my heart! The mining team'll remember you as heroes... as will the rest of the Underworld.
:'''Antonia:''' Please tell Natasha that we're ready to get back to work... If the cable car station can start operating again, we'll dispatch a mining representative to negotiate with the Architects.
----


