:'''March 7th:''' Quick, let's head over!

;(Talk to Joshua)
----
:'''Gertie:''' Oh my, this doesn't look good... Can you hear me? Are you okay?
:'''Joshua:''' H&mdash;He's still breathing! T&mdash;Try not to p&mdash;panic Aunt Gertie...
:'''March 7th:''' Is everything okay? Wait, isn't that... Peak? Don't tell me he fell asleep in the middle of the road again.
:'''Gertie:''' Oh, it's you three! Back in the Underworld so soon?
:'''Gertie:''' Word must have gotten out that I was renovating the hotel today. Being the kind-hearted young man that he is, Peak came straight over and offered to help.
:'''Gertie:''' There we were hard at work, when all of a sudden the hotel started shaking... I got everyone outside as fast as I could, but I think Peak was hit by a ceiling tile...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Are you sure he was "hard at work...?"
::'''March 7th:''' Look! Seems like he's coming around.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Quick, mouth-to-mouth resuscitation...
::'''Dan Heng:''' I... don't think that's necessary. Look, he's awake.
----
:'''Peak:''' Huh...? Argh...
:'''Gertie:''' Peak, are you awake? Oh, thank goodness you're alright! Easy now, take your time...
:'''Peak:''' Argh, my back... I was having such a great nap, how did I...
:'''Joshua:''' A&mdash;Are you okay, bro? L&mdash;Let me take you to N&mdash;Natasha's clinic...
:'''March 7th:''' Hey, look where he was lying. What is that?
:'''Gertie:''' It's...
:'''Gertie:''' ...an old photo. I thought I lost this ages ago. How did it get...
:'''March 7th:''' Aunt Gertie, isn't that you in the photo? And Old Goethe, too! You look so young!
:'''Gertie:''' Don't I know it. My distant cousin had only just taken over the family business at the time. He wrote me a letter inviting me to head up and take a look. It's been nearly 20 years already...
:'''Gertie:''' *sigh* I remember chatting in the hotel lobby and drinking tea. I wonder if we'll ever get another chance to do that...
:'''March 7th:''' ...Y'know, we've got some good news for you, haven't we, (Trailblazer)?
:{{Black Screen|You tell Gertie about the victory...}}
:'''Gertie:''' ...Is that true? Bronya, she... I&mdash;I can't believe my ears!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Put your faith in Bronya.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You and Old Goethe will have the kettle on the stove in no time.
:'''Gertie:''' I... Hahaha! I don't know what to say! Turns out things aren't always lost forever. *sigh* It feels like better days are finally on the horizon!
:'''Gertie:''' Thank you all so much for coming to tell me the good news. I haven't felt like this in a long time... We'll get plenty of guests staying at the hotel again once the passageway is open!
:'''Gertie:''' But there's no way I'm letting them set eyes on the old place looking like this... Oh, and we're gonna need to expand the menu. Oh dear. Action stations!
:'''Peak:''' Action... stations? Already? Ooh, um &mdash; ow, oww...! My head...
:'''Gertie:''' Please let Dr. Natasha know not to worry &mdash; we're all okay... You three will have to come and stay again once the hotel is fully renovated!
----
