===Bring the good news to Gertie at the Goethe Grand Hotel{{subst:void|<!--101150107-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Boulder Town|update|Cocolia was defeated and the influence of the Stellaron weakened with her demise.<br />The great tremors from the battle made the Underworlders very concerned. Natasha would like you to go comfort them and bring the good news to everyone.<br />The Goethe Grand Hotel also seems to be affected. Go see how Gertie is doing.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
:'''March 7th:''' Hide-and-seek update... Astral Express crew &mdash; 2, The Moles &mdash; 0!
:'''Hook:''' Hmph, celebrate while you can! Hide-and-seek is best of five, y'know...
:'''Hook:''' Anyway, enough about hide-and-seek. You came all this way to tell The Moles something, so spit it out.
:'''March 7th:''' Hehe... (Trailblazer), do you wanna do the honors?
:{{Black Screen|Telling The Moles about the victory...}}
:'''Hook:''' ...
:'''Julian:''' ...
:'''March 7th:''' Huh? What's wrong? Why aren't you saying anything?
:'''Alina:''' Hook, Julian...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is our story that scary?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I wasn't expecting this reaction...
:'''Julian:''' *sob*
:'''Hook:''' ...H&mdash;Hey! Wipe your tears, Julian! You're second-in-command &mdash; no crying in front of grown-ups!
:'''Hook:''' Hmph, you three listen up. Starting from today, you are The Moles' number one rivals!
:'''March 7th:''' Rivals...? Why the heck are we rivals now? What are you talking about?
:'''Alina:''' ...Hook and Julian always wanted to defeat the villains on the surface and take back our homeland.
:'''Alina:''' But it sounds like you grown-ups just stole their thunder, so...
:'''Hook:''' Hmph! You think we're gonna accept defeat just like that!? One day The Moles will be the heroes of the Underworld and the Overworld! Then everyone will sit... sit...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sit up and take notice!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sit down and shut up!
::'''March 7th:''' ...Sit up and take notice, right?
:'''Hook:''' Ah! Yeah &mdash; sit up and take notice! I&mdash;I would've figured it out myself. I didn't need you to remind me!
:'''March 7th:''' So that's why you were so silent! Hmph, if you wanna be as awesome as us, you better start training every day~
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...And start listening to Natasha.
:'''Hook:''' Training every day... listening to the old witch... Will that really make us as awesome as you guys? In that case... deal!
:'''Hook:''' Julian, Alina, let's run back to the town! Training starts today!
:'''Julian:''' Y&mdash;Yes boss! Understood!
:'''Julian:''' Uh, Alina, I can... uh... give you a piggyback if you can't make it...
----

;(Talk to Julian)
:'''March 7th:''' Found you! You ran all the way out here just to play hide-and-seek? It's too dangerous!
:'''Julian:''' M&mdash;Miss March!? D&mdash;Didn't you go back to the surface...?
