::'''March 7th:''' Hey, it wasn't like I wanted to play! The kids forced us to...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} If we had lollipops, they'd give themselves up in no time.
::'''March 7th:''' Great idea! Shame we don't have any.
::'''Dan Heng:''' Well, we better go and find them.
:'''Julian:''' ...A&mdash;Actually, I sorta wanna go play on the swings for a while... I'll leave the seeking to you guys!

;(Talk to Alina)
:'''March 7th:''' Aha! Gotcha!
:'''Alina:''' ...Huh? Grown-ups? Where's Julian?
:'''Alina:''' Hmph, so he is a scaredy-cat. I knew he'd get someone else to talk to me...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Well, that explains "sorta wanna go play on the swings for a while..."
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's not safe here.
:'''March 7th:''' You should be happy it's us and not Natasha! If she'd found you, you'd be in big trouble already.
:'''Alina:''' Mm... I guess so. Anyway, I'm gonna go find Julian.
:'''March 7th:''' ...Do you think the Great Mine was affected by our fighting on the surface?
:'''Dan Heng:''' Let's hope we didn't cause a collapse.
:'''Natasha:''' Those kids better not have taken advantage of the chaos to go on an expedition.
:'''Natasha:''' Hook does always talk about wanting to go on a Rivet Town adventure... this could be bad.
{{Dialogue End}}

